+### Standard permissions in this experimental runtime
+
+Archetypes must use standard anchor permissions (owner, public, root grants and
+ group grants). Defining or inheriting a custom `__jac_access__` raises `TypeError`
+at class registration; assigning an instance override is also rejected. There is
+no compatibility switch. Native graph queries and TTG SQL apply standard ACL
+conditions at every hop, including untyped intermediate nodes. SQL templates no
+longer enumerate all persisted node types to prove the absence of custom hooks.
